1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,822
Railway track pe ye gitti sajawat nahi hai.

2
00:00:02,842 --> 00:00:05,138
Inke bina train patri se utar sakti hai!

3
00:00:05,158 --> 00:00:07,705
Asal mein train ka wazan sleepers pe aata hai,

4
00:00:07,725 --> 00:00:10,313
aur gitti us wazan ko zameen pe faila deti hai.

5
00:00:10,333 --> 00:00:14,547
Saath hi baarish ka paani turant neeche nikal jaata hai, taaki zameen keechad na bane.

6
00:00:14,567 --> 00:00:17,613
Aur Mai-June ki garmi mein, patri khud tedhi ho sakti hai!

7
00:00:17,633 --> 00:00:21,305
Dhoop mein lohe ki patri failti hai — aur jagah na mile to mud jaati hai.

8
00:00:21,325 --> 00:00:24,997
Gitti sleepers ko jakad ke rakhti hai, taaki track apni jagah se na hile.

9
00:00:25,017 --> 00:00:27,355
Aur ye gitti nukeeli hoti hai, gol nahi —

10
00:00:27,375 --> 00:00:30,672
gol patthar ludak jaate hai, nukeele aapas mein phas jaate hain.

11
00:00:30,692 --> 00:00:32,697
Gitti sajawat nahi, suraksha hai!

12
00:00:32,717 --> 00:00:35,263
Aur haan — gamle ke liye utha ke mat le jaana.

13
00:00:35,283 --> 00:00:38,580
Apna next 'Why' comment karo, aur subscribe karo Whysplained ko!
